\ A word returns a quotation as its output. The escaping literal [ 7 ] is
\ discovered and compiled by the freeze pass; the epilogue now reifies it into a
\ concrete runtime Value with its compiled code_ptr attached instead of bailing,
\ so the returned quotation builds and is callable natively interpreter-free.
seven: ( -- q ) [ [ 7 ] ] ;
\ The headline [ drop [ 7 ] ] shape: drops its input, returns [ 7 ].
make-seven: ( x -- q ) [ drop [ 7 ] ] ;

seven call .
99 make-seven call .
